    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before you is a boundless scorched wasteland littered with the rusty wreckage of a past world. The ruins of cities buried beneath the sands hold dangerous secrets, and the roads are teeming with monsters. In this world there are no laws, only brute force and iron will. Take your weapons in your hands and get ready for merciless battles. But be careful: ammo is worth its weight in gold, and enemies give no mercy. Will you be able to survive in this hell and last at least one more day?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized graphics  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Increasing difficulty </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Different weapons</p>",
